<title>FINLAND: Finland Bank reserves fall FIM 65 million in week.</title>
<headline>Finland Bank reserves fall FIM 65 million in week.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest balance sheet for the week to October 23 showed the following positions in millions of markka compared to October 15</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 37,024	 37,089</p>
<p> Money market intervention    11,803	 11,803</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		5,998	  5,999</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 2,422	  2,426</p>
<p> Total assets		     65,243	 65,295</p>
<p>In the previous week to October 15 reserves rose by 280 million markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
